@page
@model PrivacyModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<h2>@ViewData["Title"]</h2>
<p class="text-muted">Last updated: 6 October 2026</p>
<hr />

<h4>1. Overview</h4>
<p>
    This BMI Calculator is a demonstration application built as part of the
    M.Sc. in DevOps (Continuous Software Delivery module) at TU Dublin. It
    does not collect, store, or transmit any personal data.
</p>

<h4>2. What data we process</h4>
<p>
    The values you enter (weight in stones/pounds, height in feet/inches) are
    used only to calculate your Body Mass Index for the current page load.
    They are held in memory for the duration of the request and are
    <strong>not</strong> written to a database, log file, or any storage
    system.
</p>

<h4>3. Cookies</h4>
<p>
    This application does not set any tracking or advertising cookies. The
    only cookie used is the standard ASP.NET Core session cookie, which is
    required for the form to function correctly. It contains no personal
    information and expires when you close your browser.
</p>

<h4>4. Third parties</h4>
<p>
    The application is hosted on Microsoft Azure App Service. Azure may
    collect standard telemetry (such as request counts and response times)
    in accordance with
    <a href="https://privacy.microsoft.com/en-us/privacystatement"
       target="_blank" rel="noopener">Microsoft's Privacy Statement</a>.
    No personal data entered into the calculator is included in that
    telemetry.
</p>

<h4>5. Changes to this policy</h4>
<p>
    As this is a teaching project, this policy may be updated during the
    course of the module. The "Last updated" date at the top of this page
    reflects the most recent revision.
</p>

<h4>6. Contact</h4>
<p>
    This application is maintained for educational purposes.
    For questions about the module, please contact your lecturer through
    the TU Dublin Brightspace portal.
</p>